{
  "$schema": "https://open-design.ai/schemas/plugin.v1.json",
  "specVersion": "1.0.0",
  "name": "example-fs-electric-studio",
  "title": "Electric Studio",
  "title_i18n": {
    "en": "Electric Studio",
    "zh-CN": "钴蓝工作室"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Bold, clean split-panel HTML decks: white panel over cobalt #4361ee, brand marks in the corners, a dark accent bar on the panel edge, quote typography as the hero element, all-Manrope (800/400), confident restrained spacing. Fixed 1920x1080 stage scaled uniformly to any viewport, zero dependencies. Based on zarazhangrui/frontend-slides electric-studio (STYLE_PRESETS section 2).",
  "description_i18n": {
    "en": "Bold, clean split-panel HTML decks: white panel over cobalt #4361ee, brand marks in the corners, a dark accent bar on the panel edge, quote typography as the hero element, all-Manrope (800/400), confident restrained spacing. Fixed 1920x1080 stage scaled uniformly to any viewport, zero dependencies. Based on zarazhangrui/frontend-slides electric-studio (STYLE_PRESETS section 2).",
    "zh-CN": "大胆干净的上下分割面板 HTML 幻灯片：白色面板 × 钴蓝 #4361ee 面板，四角 brand marks，面板接缝处深色 accent bar，引文排印作为主视觉，全 Manrope（800/400），克制自信的留白。固定 1920x1080 舞台等比缩放适配任意视口，零依赖单文件。Based on zarazhangrui/frontend-slides electric-studio (STYLE_PRESETS section 2)。"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "zarazhangrui",
    "url": "https://github.com/zarazhangrui"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zarazhangrui/frontend-slides",
  "plugin": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/zarazhangrui/frontend-slides"
  },
  "tags": [
    "community",
    "deck",
    "slides",
    "presentation",
    "split-panel",
    "cobalt",
    "bold",
    "manrope",
    "web",
    "ppt"
  ],
  "compat": {
    "agentSkills": [
      {
        "path": "./SKILL.md"
      }
    ]
  },
  "od": {
    "kind": "scenario",
    "taskKind": "new-generation",
    "mode": "deck",
    "scenario": "product",
    "surface": "web",
    "preview": {
      "type": "html",
      "entry": "./example.html",
      "motion": "deck"
    },
    "useCase": {
      "query": {
        "en": "Create an Electric Studio {{deckType}} for {{audience}} about {{topic}} with {{slideCount}}, as a {{density}} deck. Output one self-contained single-file HTML deck with zero dependencies (all CSS/JS inline, no build step, no external JS libraries, icons as inline SVG, charts as pure CSS). The Electric Studio theme is LOCKED - start from this plugin's example.html seed and replace content only; never redesign. Hard rules: (1) Fixed 16:9 stage - author every slide on a 1920x1080 canvas inside .deck-viewport > .deck-stage and scale the whole stage uniformly with one transform (factor = min(innerWidth/1920, innerHeight/1080), centered with letterbox); never reflow content per device, no responsive breakpoints inside slides; keep the seed's full viewport-base.css block and the entire SlidePresentation controller script verbatim (keyboard arrows/Space/PageUp/PageDown/Home/End, debounced wheel, touch swipe, #/<index> hash routing, page counter chrome fixed outside the scaled stage). (2) Each page is one <section class=\"slide\"> switched via .active/.visible classes toggling visibility/opacity/pointer-events - never display:none. (3) Locked design tokens, all in :root and nowhere else: --bg-dark:#0a0a0a; --bg-white:#ffffff; --accent-blue:#4361ee; --text-dark:#0a0a0a; --text-light:#ffffff; soft variants --text-dark-soft:rgba(10,10,10,.58), --text-light-soft:rgba(255,255,255,.72); hairlines --line-dark:rgba(10,10,10,.14), --line-light:rgba(255,255,255,.28); --blue-soft:rgba(67,97,238,.10). No other hues - no gradients, no purple, no warm accents. (4) Locked typography: Manrope only (Google Fonts, weights 400/500/800); display type is Manrope 800 with tight negative letter-spacing (-0.025em to -0.035em); body is 400/500; kickers and marks are 800 uppercase with wide tracking. Never substitute another typeface. (5) Locked layout system - every slide is a vertical two-panel split (.split > .panel-white + .edge-bar + .panel-blue): white panel above, cobalt #4361ee panel below, with a 14px dark #0a0a0a accent bar (.edge-bar) on the panel seam; vary only the split ratio per master (50/50 title, shallow-top dividers/closings with the blue panel dominant, deep-top content slides with a blue takeaway strip). Brand marks sit in the four corners of every slide (.mark-tl/.mark-tr/.mark-bl/.mark-br): cobalt chip + wordmark top-left, section label top-right, deck label bottom-left, NN / NN page mark bottom-right; marks over white are dark, marks over blue are light. (6) Quote typography is the hero visual language: at least one quote-hero slide with an oversized cobalt ldquo mark and Manrope 800 statement type around 92px; no photography, no illustrations - type, flat panels, and the cobalt chip are the only decoration; keep spacing confident and restrained. (7) Compose slides from the seed's masters: title (50/50 statement), agenda (numbered rows on blue), section divider (outlined giant number on cobalt), bullets (ticks on white + takeaway strip on blue), big stat (oversized cobalt number), quote hero, comparison (white panel = their way vs blue panel = our way), 2x2 principle grid on cobalt, pure-CSS bar chart (cobalt bars, scaleY entrance), closing (blue dominant statement). (8) Motion: entrances only via .reveal elements staggered with transition-delay (~0.1s steps) when the slide gains .visible; single easing cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); animate only transform and opacity; prefers-reduced-motion support stays. (9) No scrolling, no overflow; split content into more slides instead of shrinking type; low-density speaker-led decks get one idea per slide with 1-3 bullets, high-density reading-first decks get structured grids with max 4-6 cards.",
        "zh-CN": "用 Electric Studio（钴蓝工作室）锁定主题为 {{audience}} 创作一套关于 {{topic}} 的 {{deckType}}（{{slideCount}}，{{density}}）：零依赖单文件 HTML，固定 1920x1080 舞台等比缩放；每页都是「白上 × 钴蓝 #4361ee 下」的上下分割面板，面板接缝 14px 深色 accent bar，四角 brand marks（钴蓝色块 + 字标 / 章节 / 页码），全 Manrope（display 800 紧排印、正文 400/500），引文排印为主视觉，无照片无插画、仅平面色块与排印装饰。从插件内 example.html 种子出发，保留舞台缩放系统、SlidePresentation 导航脚本与 :root token 原样，只替换内容；禁止引入规格外的颜色和字体。完整硬性规格以英文 prompt 为准。"
      },
      "exampleOutputs": [
        {
          "path": "./example.html",
          "title": "Voltaic Studio - Electric Studio capabilities deck",
          "title_i18n": {
            "en": "Voltaic Studio - Electric Studio capabilities deck",
            "zh-CN": "Voltaic Studio · 钴蓝工作室能力介绍演示"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "name": "deckType",
        "label": "Deck type",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "studio / agency capabilities deck",
          "pitch deck",
          "product overview",
          "conference talk",
          "internal presentation"
        ],
        "default": "studio / agency capabilities deck"
      },
      {
        "name": "topic",
        "label": "Topic",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "Voltaic Studio capabilities 2026",
        "default": "the user's brief"
      },
      {
        "name": "audience",
        "label": "Audience",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "Prospective clients evaluating design partners",
        "default": "a general professional audience"
      },
      {
        "name": "slideCount",
        "label": "Length",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "short 5-10 slides",
          "medium 10-20 slides",
          "long 20+ slides"
        ],
        "default": "short 5-10 slides"
      },
      {
        "name": "density",
        "label": "Density",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "low density / speaker-led",
          "high density / reading-first"
        ],
        "default": "low density / speaker-led"
      }
    ],
    "context": {
      "skills": [
        {
          "path": "./SKILL.md"
        }
      ],
      "assets": [
        "./example.html"
      ]
    },
    "pipeline": {
      "stages": [
        {
          "id": "discovery",
          "atoms": [
            "discovery-question-form"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "generate",
          "atoms": [
            "file-write",
            "live-artifact"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "capabilities": [
      "prompt:inject",
      "fs:write"
    ]
  }
}
